ugate of the denominator:\n\\[ z_3 = \\frac{(37263 + 37266i)(37263 + 37264i)}{(37263 - 37264i)(37263 + 37264i)} = \\frac{1388613169 + 37263 \\cdot 37264i + 37266 \\cdot 37263i - 1388613184}{1388613169 + 1388613184} = \\frac{-15 + 74535i}{2777226353} = -\\frac{15}{2777226353} + \\frac{74535}{2777226353}i \\]\n\n4. Calculate \\( z_4 = F(z_3) \\):\n\\[ z_4 = F\\left(-\\frac{15}{2777226353} + \\frac{74535}{2777226353}i\\right) = \\frac{\\left(-\\frac{15}{2777226353} + \\frac{74535}{2777226353}i\\right) + i}{\\left(-\\frac{15}{2777226353} + \\frac{74535}{2777226353}i\\right) - i} = \\frac{-15 + 74535i + 2777226353i}{-15 + 74535i - 2777226353i} = \\frac{-15 + 2777233888i}{-15 - 2777218818i} \\]\nAgain, we multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:\n\\[ z_4 = \\frac{(-15 + 2777233888i)(-15 + 2777218818i)}{(-15 - 2777218818i)(-15 + 2777218818i)} = \\frac{225 - 15 \\cdot 2777218818i - 15 \\cdot 2777233888i - 7711216752484064}{225 + 7711216752484064} = \\frac{-7711216752484289 - 41658582810i}{7711216752484289} = -1 - \\frac{41658582810}{7711216752484289}i \\]\n\n5. Calculate \\( z_5 = F(z_4) \\):\n\\[ z_5 = F(-1 - \\frac{41658582810}{7711216752484289}i) = \\frac{(-1 - \\frac{41658582810}{7711216752484289}i) + i}{(-1 - \\frac{41658582810}{7711216752484289}i) - i} = \\frac{-1 + \\frac{7711216752480179}{7711216752484289}i}{-1 - \\frac{7711216752488459}{7711216752484289}i} = \\frac{-7711216752484289 + 7711216752480179i}{-7711216752484289 - 7711216752488459i} \\]\nAgain, we multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:\n\\[ z_5 = \\frac{(-7711216752484289 + 7711216752480179i)(-7711216752484289 + 7711216752488459i)}{(-7711216752484289 - 7711216752488459i)(-7711216752484289 + 7711216752488459i)} = \\frac{5945072935744262524644641 + 5945072935744262524644641i}{5945072935744262524644641 + 5945072935744262524644641} = 1 + i \\]\n\n6. Calculate \\( z_6 = F(z_5) \\):\n\\[ z_6 = F(1 + i) = \\frac{(1 + i) + i}{(1 + i) -